Here is a complete HTML file that implements a Space Invaders arcade game, designed to replicate the original 1978 Taito cabinet experience.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Space Invaders – 1978 Taito</title>
    <style>
        /* Reset & base */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
                background: #000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #1a1a2 0%, #000 100%);
        }

        /* Arcane cabinet */
        .game-container {
            background: #111;
            border: 4px solid #333;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 8px 20px 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 0.3), inset 0 0 20px #000;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .cabinet {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        canvas {
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #000;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            width: 800px;
            height: 800px;
            border: 2px solid #0f0;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px #0f0, 0 0 10px #0f0;
        }

        /* Original overlay */
        .scanlines {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                0deg,
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px,
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 
